@base = http://localhost:5003
@key = dev-api-key

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Readiness (checks the database)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Record a click (normally sent by the redirect service)
POST {{base}}/api/clicks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "ghub", "clickedAtUtc": "2026-10-05T10:00:00Z", "referrer": "https://google.com", "userAgent": "REST Client" }

### Force a stats recalculation (otherwise runs on a timer)
POST {{base}}/api/stats/recalculate
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Top links by clicks
GET {{base}}/api/stats?take=20
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Stats for one code
GET {{base}}/api/stats/ghub
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
